LICENSE STATUS

This repository contains software developed as part of the NASA FINESST
project:

"Beyond Detection: Evaluating Space-Based Interferometry for
Complementary Characterization of Potentially Hazardous Near-Earth
Objects"

NASA Award: 80NSSC26K0350

The approved Open Science and Data Management Plan anticipates public
release of project software under the NASA Open Source Agreement (NOSA),
Version 1.3.

The final software license and associated release metadata are currently
being confirmed with Purdue University and NASA. No substantive project
software is presently being distributed from this repository under an
open-source license.

Once the appropriate release authorization and metadata are confirmed,
this file will be replaced with the applicable license.
